# Maestro sweep artifact directories — local-only debug evidence
# (per-flow maestro.log + screenshots + cassure-report.json + oslog).
# Findings docs at .planning/_walker/sweep-*-FINDINGS.md ARE versioned ;
# the timestamped artifact dirs are not (regenerable, ~MB each).
.planning/_walker/sweep-2[0-9]*T[0-9]*/
.planning/_walker/sweep-2[0-9]*-[0-9]*-[0-9]*T*/

# Maestro `takeScreenshot:` dumps numbered PNGs at the working dir
